@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### Verified snapshot identity
GET {{base}}/v1/snapshot

### Alphabet FY2024, exact USD amounts and ratio pairs
GET {{base}}/v1/cashflow?symbol=GOOGL&period=2024

### Follow Apple cash capex to its filing
GET {{base}}/v1/facts?symbol=AAPL&period=2024&metric=capex

### Page through source facts, retaining the snapshot ID
GET {{base}}/v1/facts?limit=7&offset=7

### Inspect source contracts and Python/DuckDB parity
GET {{base}}/v1/quality

### Unsupported cutoff must return 422
GET {{base}}/v1/cashflow?as_of=1900-01-01
